      "lines": [
        "Multi-head Attention",
        "http://jalammar.github.io/illustrated-transformer/",
        "1) Create query, key, and value",
        "vectors for all attentions heads",
        "2) Compute new",
        "input representations",
        "3) Condense all representations",
        "into a single representation by",
        "concatenating z-s and",
        "multiplying by a weight matrix"
      ]
    },
